#: ../../tools/eol_tools.rst:32 9beb5d5e598340fc9c72e6a82e2c26fc
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get a curated collection from the Encyclopedia of Life. "
"EOL collections are user-curated lists of species pages organized by "
"theme (e.g., endangered species, invasive species, species of a region). "
"Returns collection name, description, and member items with their page "
"IDs. Supports pagination and filtering by object type (taxa, articles, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""

